<unit id="e1b8c82e-0ec2-4ede-ade1-f53db2448545">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 8</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Introduction</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="daf9a5da-cc04-469e-b191-2dc163f35b99">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 10</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Welcome to the **Contact Manager for NVDA**!</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="57d0a21b-d607-453c-a82f-060ac0cc465b">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 12</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>This add-on was developed to help blind or visually impaired users manage their contact list in a practical, accessible, and efficient way.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="fb998ffb-24f2-491b-ad32-ca9d3ba0bb2d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 14</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>With this tool, you can:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="0be9f633-b1fd-4ce4-9d65-37c13da28557">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 16</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Add, edit, delete, and search for contacts;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="bb59450f-389f-4c8b-8d6b-ff526f14b36b">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 17</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Import and export contact lists in CSV format;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f97a4dda-3707-46f5-8338-1399d81ce5f2">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 18</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Apply custom phone number formatting;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="80c8b099-06a1-4b18-9560-3d118d14fafc">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 19</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Choose a custom location to store your contact database;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="0c9e3edd-7ab3-46cb-9e11-ede1f3c0c12f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 20</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Navigate an intuitive and fully keyboard-accessible interface.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="1e82fab8-e6c0-46ec-b23a-befcd13c85d4">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 22</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Installation</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="8aff707c-bef9-42a6-8a12-71e2b0de64c3">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 24</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In NVDA, open the **Tools** menu and go to the **Add-on Store**.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="cbbb144f-a675-490b-b408-e55cd86d9ad2">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 25</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Under the **Available Add-ons** tab, use the **Search** field and look for `Contact Manager`.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="273436c8-7a3d-4308-b9ae-fb498f8569bb">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 26</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 3. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Select it, press **Enter** or click **Apply**, and choose **Install**.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="b9418d19-f4d8-4f72-8ad1-0931a492abee">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 27</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 4. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Restart NVDA to complete the installation.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="e501b405-15f7-4808-aecd-847859c87683">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 29</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Once installed, the add-on is ready to use.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="49a3faeb-f8cf-4808-9a9f-3939ee10acc9">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 31</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>When you select a contact in the list, their details will be shown in a read-only text box. You can navigate the list using the first letter of the contact’s name.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f811d4ba-4c8b-4437-ab3c-bcd87a244a4c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 33</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Configuration</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="a793d4d3-c6b5-4e8a-b173-650a91a26988">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 35</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Access the settings panel from:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="9804dc6b-b5c6-45ae-ab06-2d7117cd4a4d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 36</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**NVDA Menu &gt; Preferences &gt; Settings &gt; Contact Manager for NVDA**</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="4f64110c-b772-4d58-9f41-efc49a9e5d65">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 38</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Available options:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="fe33af74-2cdc-484f-b69b-56f3efacffca">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 40</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Phone number masking**: Use `#` to apply a formatting mask (e.g., for Brazilian numbers).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="7b390185-caae-401b-9052-3cde7741f65c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 41</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Allow clearing all contacts** (`Alt+T`): Enables a button to delete all entries in the contact list.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="aa76d738-42e7-46bf-849c-1e5c8306743b">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 42</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 3. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Enable CSV import** (`Alt+I`): Shows a button to import contacts from CSV files.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ec9d6f0f-1060-450a-b608-2e0c6bdef8d3">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 43</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 4. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Enable CSV export** (`Alt+X`): Shows a button to export the contact list to a CSV file.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="73434449-424e-4be1-a194-1e588b52cb64">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 44</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 5. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>**Contact file directory**: Set a custom path for storing your agenda file.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="b09edc9c-cf36-492e-9f01-f83868721cb5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 46</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Accessing the Add-on</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="97c3b756-d5c5-4db4-ba51-4ad47056faaa">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 48</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>You can open the Contact Manager in two ways:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="8f133899-6a5f-4eb3-b33e-370e2045130f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 50</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Keyboard shortcut: `Windows+Alt+L`</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="fcdc6b96-b891-4479-9e0e-3192e1cef25c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 51</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>NVDA Menu: `NVDA+N &gt; Tools &gt; Contact Manager`</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="b45550ee-d0b0-428a-9304-fc3eaca24e5a">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 53</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>In the main window, you can:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="179747c3-5fba-47b7-abe8-a683698b5b16">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 55</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Add, edit, and delete contacts;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ebf9625d-feff-496d-93b9-5a2e752b065c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 56</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Search for specific contacts;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f0bad350-5c1c-44fd-b756-826420f9c6c6">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 57</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Import and export CSV files;</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ebaacc18-59c9-4f79-ac22-4a7dc1d097dc">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 58</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Delete all records in the contact list (if enabled).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="0f29626a-442c-4de2-8c19-2d68c6a59233">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 60</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Adding a New Contact</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="f66565dc-474a-4be5-a335-7c335ce22713">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 62</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Open the Contact Manager (`Windows+Alt+L` or via menu).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="38e52d58-f2e6-4d88-8af2-e02d65a24002">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 63</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+N` to add a new contact.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="85b2dc93-2ec8-4947-af5d-9ee4ad2e2752">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 64</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 3. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Fill out the fields.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="a6be7109-da81-43fd-bda7-663eeb474923">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 65</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 4. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+O` to save or `Alt+C` to cancel.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="34ee2665-86d8-4a81-9f47-a785fe410459">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 67</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>&gt; **Note:** Use **Enter** to navigate between fields.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="58f2b1f5-5ce2-4658-8dcf-c836806e6d17">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 68</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>&gt; The **Tab** key may behave unpredictably due to a known issue.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="499fae0f-6b09-49b4-9388-e547c0f08903">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 70</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Editing a Contact</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="8530956d-71b2-44b4-8190-b09803d9c667">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 72</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Select a contact from the list.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="83b89be6-4c91-4080-b739-bb9fe94908b7">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 73</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+E` or `F2`.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="416f66b2-275f-4d66-afc2-4e851c545d36">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 74</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 3. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Make your changes.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5ef80543-8476-43ba-9892-4cee7f4cb3d7">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 75</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 4. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+O` to save or `Alt+C` to cancel.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="938a3cdc-63ad-462a-9a1d-61b17eedbefc">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 77</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Searching Contacts</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="507f4553-6692-4c94-a266-312e6660a96d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 79</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 1. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Type a search term (name, phone, or email).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="6dc57219-5546-4313-98af-c028e642770a">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 80</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 2. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+P` to filter the results.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="4b9108f0-3c7b-4631-9471-3b2e4eb457bd">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 81</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: 3. </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Press `Alt+A` or `F5` to refresh the full list.</source>
</segment>
